# Sprinting extras (SPEC Sprinting: Camera, Sneaking). FOV is data/input.toml's
# fov_degrees (70) widening by fov_extra_degrees (10) over fov_ease_seconds (0.15).
# The water rule (no sprint start in water, entering water ends it) has no case
# here: the walking player can't reach the raft scene's water, so the Rust tests
# for it (#862) cover it.

case the FOV widens during a sprint and eases back after it
start walk raft
click
lock
runway 12
frame 50 x2
expect fov ~ 70
press KeyW
down KeyW
frame 50 x2
expect sprinting = true
expect fov > 70
frame 50 x6
expect fov ~ 80
up KeyW
frame 50 x6
expect sprinting = false
expect fov ~ 70

case starting to sneak during a sprint ends it and the FOV eases back
start walk raft
click
lock
runway 12
press KeyW
down KeyW
frame 50 x6
expect sprinting = true
expect fov ~ 80
down ShiftLeft
frame 50 x6
expect sprinting = false
expect fov ~ 70

case a double-tap while sneaking does not start a sprint
start walk raft
click
lock
runway 12
down ShiftLeft
press KeyW
frame 50 x2
down KeyW
frame 50 x6
expect sprinting = false
expect fov ~ 70
